ent":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1381784-so-ezekiel-of-sodom-is-something-else?p=1381787#post1381787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What book is he from? Idk him.</div> </div> </div> </div>The supplemental book Thousand Years of Night. It\u2019s an interesting book, not the best, but still worth reading in my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T16:46:50-07:00","id":1381801,"title":"","content":"::cough:: Mary Sue ::cough::","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T17:05:21-07:00","id":1381813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1381784-so-ezekiel-of-sodom-is-something-else#post1381784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He\u2019s so powerful and mighty, he can use Devotions that Require Protean with no dots in Protean at all.. and has access to the Swarm Form merit to boot! Now that\u2019s some Samuel Haight level of talent right there.. must be a perk of being a BP 10 Akhud Methuselah. What are your thoughts on the matter? A simple matter of the writers confusing Praestantia for Protean, a word count limit related accidental omission of Protean, a sudden Clan change at the last minute.. or divine empowerment from God? My money\u2019s on the latter option personally.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pre-errata version has Protean 5 and no Praestantia (or Obfuscate, despite still having Shatter the Shroud) as well as two fewer dots in Celerity. Errata-gathering period was nearly three years ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T17:46:47-07:00","id":1381824,"title":"","content":"Ohhhhh. I read that book! I remember him. I thought he was one of the Akhud too, but now that you mention it it does seem weird for an Akhud to have Protean 5 and no dots in Praestantia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T17:48:51-07:00","id":1381826,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1686_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1686\" data-vbnamecard=\"1686\">Korogra</a> and I just realized you were being sarcastic. Nobody likes Samuel Haight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T18:11:49-07:00","id":1381833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1381784-so-ezekiel-of-sodom-is-something-else?p=1381813#post1381813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pre-errata version has Protean 5 and no Praestantia (or Obfuscate, despite still having Shatter the Shroud) as well as two fewer dots in Celerity. Errata-gathering period was nearly three years ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a thread for humor rather than errata, if my reference to Samuel Haight wasn\u2019t clear enough. I didn\u2019t have the book pre-errata period, but judging by the two Protean Devotions that are still included I have no doubt that was the case.<br /> <br /> But really, I brought this up because I found it funny more than anything, I don\u2019t expect it to be fixed.<br /> <br /> Now that I\u2019m thinking about it though, I do like the idea of him drawing upon the power of these Devotions through the collective diablerist legacy of his Clan pumping within his veins; perhaps Akhud who are old enough can manifest Disciplines or Devotions In which they normally couldn\u2019t have access to.. so long as at least one vampire in their sire-lineage possessed such abilities.<br /> <br /> That would be a pretty cool little quirk of their Blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-15T18:12:42-07:00","id":1381834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1381784-so-ezekiel-of-sodom-is-something-else?p=1381826#post1381826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> and I just realized you were being sarcastic. Nobody likes Samuel Haight.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I like how he ended up as an ash